WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:17.370
Hakuren Jr. High's hissatsu tactics, Absolute Barrier...

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:19.830
Just how strong could it be?

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:22.410
<i>I watched you guys on TV.</i>

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:25.830
<i>Not even your Ultimate Thunder is likely to break past them.</i>

00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:32.130
<i>You'll need an even stronger hissatsu tactics to break past Absolute Barrier.</i>

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:34.950
<i>We did it!</i>

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:37.250
<i>That was amazing, Tsurugi, Tenma!</i>

00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:39.590
<i>You completed the hissatsu tactics!</i>

00:00:39.590 --> 00:00:40.110
<i>Yeah!</i>

00:00:41.530 --> 00:00:44.310
With Double Wing, things will definitely be able to work out somehow!

00:00:51.350 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>You betrayed Hakuren... and  </i>me!

00:00:55.230 --> 00:00:57.530
<i>Now you're just an enemy I need to defeat.</i>

00:00:59.210 --> 00:01:00.360
Yukimura...

00:01:00.820 --> 00:01:02.790
It's not me you need to defeat.

00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:17.290
It's cold...

00:01:17.290 --> 00:01:19.760
Was the air-conditioning lowered too much by mistake?

00:01:19.760 --> 00:01:22.030
Not at <i>this</i>  level, it ain't.

00:01:24.770 --> 00:01:26.060
What is this place?!

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:36.600
It's frozen solid.

00:01:37.070 --> 00:01:39.390
This is today's field?

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:44.630
Today's game between Raimon versus Hakuren takes place at...

00:01:45.380 --> 00:01:47.860
Snowland Stadium!

00:03:28.610 --> 00:03:30.260
Hikaru, here I come!

00:03:30.260 --> 00:03:30.900
Okay!

00:03:43.310 --> 00:03:44.770
It's really slippery.

00:03:45.270 --> 00:03:46.980
Here I come, Hamano-kun!

00:03:46.980 --> 00:03:48.110
Okay!

00:03:55.100 --> 00:03:56.160
Ow...

00:03:56.160 --> 00:03:57.710
Are you okay?

00:03:57.710 --> 00:04:01.880
How does anyone expect us to play soccer on this?

00:04:06.160 --> 00:04:06.800
Yukimura!

00:04:13.570 --> 00:04:14.930
Wow...

00:04:14.930 --> 00:04:17.690
They're used to playing on slippery fields.

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:20.570
Yeah, just what you'd expect in a team from the north.

00:04:21.630 --> 00:04:27.020
On a field like this, Hakuren can demonstrate 120% of its power.

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:30.130
This is going to be a hard fight.

00:04:30.590 --> 00:04:31.640
Yeah.

00:04:33.270 --> 00:04:34.320
Everyone!

00:04:36.090 --> 00:04:37.660
I have good news.

00:04:37.660 --> 00:04:39.580
Nishiki-kun is back home!

00:04:40.260 --> 00:04:41.230
Nishiki?

00:04:41.230 --> 00:04:42.470
He's back?

00:04:42.470 --> 00:04:43.620
Nishiki-kun?

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:44.560
Is that true?

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:47.930
Yes, he just called to say he arrived at the airport.

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:49.530
He's heading our way right now.

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:53.090
It sure is a surprise to hear him being back so suddenly.

00:04:53.090 --> 00:04:55.500
It's so reassuring to know he's here!

00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:59.610
Yeah, he'll make goals for us again with his powerful shoots!

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:02.740
We'll get to see plays trained in Italy!

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:05.100
Yeah, this is exciting!

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:08.690
Haruna, is it still possible to register an additional player?

00:05:08.690 --> 00:05:09.600
Yes.

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:10.900
Good, then go for it.

00:05:10.900 --> 00:05:11.620
Okay!

00:05:18.490 --> 00:05:20.300
Just you wait, guys!

00:05:20.300 --> 00:05:22.090
I'll be right there!

00:05:27.480 --> 00:05:30.750
Raimon's Holy Road ends here today.

00:05:30.750 --> 00:05:31.550
I'll destroy you.

00:05:31.950 --> 00:05:33.610
We won't let ourselves be destroyed.

00:05:33.610 --> 00:05:35.990
We'll fight to the very end!

00:05:37.410 --> 00:05:39.760
We have to take back real soccer!

00:05:39.760 --> 00:05:41.310
There's no way we can afford to lose!

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:44.690
The game will begin momentarily!

00:05:44.690 --> 00:05:50.620
Raimon Jr. High lead by Coach Endou and Hakuren Jr. High lead by Coach Kumazaki!

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:55.870
What fiery battle will they show us on this field of ice?

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:02.800
Yukimura, you must realize.

00:06:03.330 --> 00:06:06.460
Hakuren is going down the wrong path right now.

00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:12.180
I'll show you the soccer that I believe in!

00:06:13.910 --> 00:06:16.520
The match begins with Raimon's kickoff!

00:06:17.630 --> 00:06:19.180
It's hard to run straight...

00:06:21.650 --> 00:06:23.230
Oh no!

00:06:23.660 --> 00:06:26.670
Kurama loses the ball due to a dribbling miss!

00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:28.070
Damn it!

00:06:34.460 --> 00:06:35.160
Hayami!

00:06:35.490 --> 00:06:36.440
Okay!

00:06:40.270 --> 00:06:41.450
A pass miss?

00:06:41.450 --> 00:06:44.260
No, their timing is thrown off.

00:06:44.260 --> 00:06:46.420
The slickness of the ice is making the ball speed up.

00:06:46.860 --> 00:06:50.020
And since they can't gain a footing on the ice, 
 they're unable to react to the change.

00:06:51.360 --> 00:06:54.390
This is how soccer is played in Holy Road...

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:57.430
I have to do something!

00:06:57.700 --> 00:06:59.930
You can't do anything by running like that!

00:07:00.960 --> 00:07:02.420
I won't let you have it!

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:04.270
It's mine!

00:07:05.050 --> 00:07:07.710
Yukimura steals the ball from Matsukaze!

00:07:07.710 --> 00:07:09.470
He charges into Raimon's camp!

00:07:09.830 --> 00:07:12.490
He's gotten even faster than when I last saw him.

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:18.100
I won't let you!

00:07:19.110 --> 00:07:21.620
There's a nice defense by Kirino!

00:07:21.880 --> 00:07:23.750
He saves Raimon from danger!

00:07:29.490 --> 00:07:30.960
Back then...

00:07:30.960 --> 00:07:33.030
I met you for the first time.

00:07:34.860 --> 00:07:35.960
There it goes!

00:07:35.960 --> 00:07:37.350
Stop him, Oujika!

00:07:43.100 --> 00:07:44.110
All right!

00:07:44.110 --> 00:07:45.420
It's not all right!

00:07:45.420 --> 00:07:46.290
What?

00:07:46.290 --> 00:07:47.700
Don't go crazy.

00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:49.010
It's just practice.

00:07:49.010 --> 00:07:50.230
So what?

00:07:50.230 --> 00:07:50.960
What?!

00:07:51.630 --> 00:07:53.730
Practice or not, it doesn't matter.

00:07:53.730 --> 00:07:56.690
You have to be serious at what you do, no matter what stage it is.

00:07:57.380 --> 00:07:59.020
Otherwise, you can't move forward!

00:08:00.270 --> 00:08:02.750
Oh, really. Have fun with that.

00:08:07.090 --> 00:08:10.880
You have to be serious at what you do, no matter what stage it is.

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:12.760
Otherwise, you can't move forward!

00:08:25.220 --> 00:08:27.720
That's an amazing shoot you have.

00:08:36.690 --> 00:08:38.880
I got stronger because I had you.

00:08:39.230 --> 00:08:41.080
At least, that's what I thought back then.

00:08:57.690 --> 00:08:58.900
Fubuki-senpai!

00:08:58.900 --> 00:09:00.100
What is it?

00:09:00.540 --> 00:09:07.370
I've never had someone who would stay with me, even when it's snowing, to help me practice seriously before.

00:09:08.470 --> 00:09:11.020
I want to get even stronger!

00:09:13.140 --> 00:09:17.370
I sincerely thought that I'd found someone I could believe in for the first time.

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:36.500
Eternal Blizzard!

00:09:39.600 --> 00:09:40.350
I did it...

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:42.650
I did it, Senpai!

00:09:42.650 --> 00:09:44.640
Yes, you did well.

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:47.780
But this is just the start.

00:09:48.530 --> 00:09:49.400
The start?

00:09:50.260 --> 00:09:54.540
One day, you'll have to come up with a hissatsu technique that's even better than mine.

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:02.720
But you abandoned me!

00:10:03.390 --> 00:10:04.330
You're wrong...

00:10:04.900 --> 00:10:06.250
You're wrong, Yukimura!

00:10:12.780 --> 00:10:14.410
Raimon is stuck on defense!

00:10:14.410 --> 00:10:16.980
They seem to be having a tough time on this ice field!

00:10:19.960 --> 00:10:22.760
This field is a difficult one.

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:23.560
Yeah.

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:32.840
I won't let you!

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:34.410
Why, you...!

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:39.420
Matsukaze stubbornly hangs on and stops Hakuren's attack!

00:10:39.900 --> 00:10:41.530
You're amazing, Tenma-kun!

00:10:41.530 --> 00:10:42.630
Captain!

00:10:47.010 --> 00:10:48.780
You can't have it!

00:10:52.050 --> 00:10:53.630
Not good enough!

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:56.730
Yukimura steals the ball!

00:10:56.730 --> 00:10:58.590
He moves on to attack!

00:10:59.960 --> 00:11:01.310
Everyone, turn back!

00:11:01.310 --> 00:11:02.170
Too late!

00:11:02.690 --> 00:11:05.090
Raimon is slow to defend!

00:11:10.890 --> 00:11:14.720
Panther Blizzard!

00:11:17.050 --> 00:11:18.150
That's...!

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:24.000
12.23. Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:11:25.610 --> 00:11:28.950
12.23. Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:11:33.910 --> 00:11:36.880
Panther Blizzard!

00:11:39.760 --> 00:11:41.300
I won't let it in!

00:11:46.930 --> 00:11:47.900
Fence Of-

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:50.820
What?

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:55.110
Goal!

00:11:55.110 --> 00:11:59.400
Hakuren wins the first point with Yukimura's hissatsu shoot!

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:00.730
Damn it!

00:12:02.520 --> 00:12:05.810
Panther Blizzard... what incredible speed...

00:12:05.810 --> 00:12:08.500
Sangoku-senpai's hissatsu technique couldn't be brought out in time.

00:12:12.210 --> 00:12:15.580
You did it. You made your own hissatsu technique.

00:12:16.020 --> 00:12:18.590
This is my ability!

00:12:22.920 --> 00:12:24.110
It's no use...

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:25.890
No matter how many times I try!

00:12:26.390 --> 00:12:27.680
Yukimura...

00:12:28.880 --> 00:12:31.980
Am I... Am I just not good enough?

00:12:37.130 --> 00:12:39.360
Is that all it takes for you to give up?

00:12:42.640 --> 00:12:44.740
No, I'll do it!

00:12:44.740 --> 00:12:46.280
Please let me!

00:12:47.180 --> 00:12:49.030
Then let's keep trying tomorrow.

00:12:49.300 --> 00:12:50.300
Okay!

00:13:13.950 --> 00:13:17.790
Ever since that day, you never showed up at Hakuren again.

00:13:18.280 --> 00:13:19.690
You betrayed me!

00:13:20.820 --> 00:13:23.130
I won't forgive you!

00:13:23.130 --> 00:13:25.820
I'll defeat you along with Raimon!

00:13:26.870 --> 00:13:28.990
It's Hakuren's chance to shoot again!

00:13:28.990 --> 00:13:31.800
Yukimura is closing in on Raimon's goal!

00:13:32.470 --> 00:13:34.140
Kariya, let's go stop him!

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:36.080
Okay!

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:39.770
Kirino blocks his path!

00:13:39.770 --> 00:13:40.690
I'll stop you!

00:13:40.690 --> 00:13:41.850
We'll see about that.

00:13:45.650 --> 00:13:46.420
What?

00:13:46.420 --> 00:13:48.890
Yukimura gets past Kirino!

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:52.640
That thing he just did...

00:13:54.140 --> 00:13:55.140
Whoa!

00:13:59.370 --> 00:14:01.040
Not happening!

00:14:01.620 --> 00:14:03.350
Kariya clears it!

00:14:03.350 --> 00:14:05.490
What incredible defense!

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:12.330
That's a great idea, Kariya!

00:14:12.520 --> 00:14:16.310
You used the edges of your spikes to control how you move!

00:14:18.100 --> 00:14:20.840
I just copied what he was doing...

00:14:21.230 --> 00:14:22.920
So <i>that's</i>  it!

00:14:23.330 --> 00:14:25.100
Let's tell the others.

00:14:25.100 --> 00:14:28.810
Now we can fight on this ice field without being afraid.

00:14:28.810 --> 00:14:31.010
Sounds good to me.

00:14:35.470 --> 00:14:38.870
Huh? Where's the train?

00:14:39.450 --> 00:14:40.980
Hey!

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:42.230
You there!

00:14:42.230 --> 00:14:46.390
The Holy Liner only runs before and after the game!

00:14:46.390 --> 00:14:47.350
What?!

00:14:47.350 --> 00:14:48.850
Is that true?

00:14:48.850 --> 00:14:50.700
That's bad!

00:14:52.770 --> 00:14:56.100
Use my spikes to control my sliding...

00:14:57.170 --> 00:14:58.300
There!

00:15:00.240 --> 00:15:01.370
See you!

00:15:04.300 --> 00:15:05.140
What?

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:06.750
Shindou!

00:15:10.260 --> 00:15:14.220
The Raimon Eleven's movements are finally getting better!

00:15:14.810 --> 00:15:16.700
Surfing Pierrot!

00:15:22.370 --> 00:15:23.420
Tenma!

00:15:23.420 --> 00:15:24.170
Okay!

00:15:28.110 --> 00:15:29.530
You won't get past!

00:15:31.010 --> 00:15:32.810
Soyokaze Step!

00:15:37.010 --> 00:15:38.280
Kurama-senpai!

00:15:43.730 --> 00:15:46.750
Sidewinder!

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:55.460
Crystal Barrier!

00:16:01.410 --> 00:16:02.160
Damn it!

00:16:02.730 --> 00:16:04.340
So close!

00:16:04.340 --> 00:16:07.100
But things are getting better!

00:16:07.100 --> 00:16:08.860
Yeah, it's heating up!

00:16:12.090 --> 00:16:14.580
Looks like everyone's got the hang of it.

00:16:15.730 --> 00:16:17.360
Come on then, attack!

00:16:17.770 --> 00:16:18.660
Yes, sir!

00:16:20.480 --> 00:16:21.490
Tsurugi!

00:16:27.510 --> 00:16:28.440
Now!

00:16:28.440 --> 00:16:30.700
Show them our power!

00:16:32.860 --> 00:16:34.080
Do it, Makari!

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:36.970
Hissatsu tactics!

00:16:38.600 --> 00:16:40.400
Absolute Barrier!

00:16:41.770 --> 00:16:42.510
What?

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:45.790
There it is.

00:16:48.200 --> 00:16:49.750
I'll break through!

00:16:55.770 --> 00:17:00.030
Hakuren's hissatsu tactics stops Raimon's attack!

00:17:00.030 --> 00:17:02.040
They stopped Tsurugi...

00:17:02.740 --> 00:17:07.690
See that? That's our Hakuren's hissatsu tactics, Absolute Barrier!

00:17:07.690 --> 00:17:10.380
No one can undo these tactics!

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:13.770
So this is the might of Absolute Barrier!

00:17:16.430 --> 00:17:17.930
It seems you've learned your place!

00:17:18.360 --> 00:17:19.750
You deserve to be praised...

00:17:19.750 --> 00:17:21.670
It's the perfect hissatsu tactics.

00:17:22.480 --> 00:17:23.880
Tenma! Tsurugi!

00:17:23.880 --> 00:17:25.590
We'll attack them with Double Wing!

00:17:25.590 --> 00:17:26.390
Got it?

00:17:26.390 --> 00:17:27.500
Okay!

00:17:27.500 --> 00:17:28.730
All right, let's go!

00:17:28.730 --> 00:17:29.640
Okay!

00:17:30.310 --> 00:17:32.650
Are they going to use Double Wing?

00:17:33.380 --> 00:17:34.400
Yeah.

00:17:41.920 --> 00:17:43.570
Hissatsu tactics!

00:17:43.570 --> 00:17:44.260
Let's go!

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:45.560
Okay!

00:17:48.480 --> 00:17:50.070
What are they up to?

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:52.200
Kurama!

00:17:52.200 --> 00:17:53.110
Right!

00:17:57.240 --> 00:17:58.050
Do it!

00:17:58.390 --> 00:18:00.290
Hissatsu tactics!

00:18:02.560 --> 00:18:04.240
Absolute Barrier!

00:18:05.940 --> 00:18:07.110
Go!

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:16.890
That's...

00:18:16.890 --> 00:18:18.860
He taught them how to counter it!

00:18:21.820 --> 00:18:23.580
Hissatsu tactics!

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:25.320
Double Wing!

00:18:27.860 --> 00:18:28.830
The left!

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:29.570
Okay!

00:18:35.080 --> 00:18:35.850
What?

00:18:36.500 --> 00:18:39.820
Raimon's hissatsu tactics bounces back!

00:18:40.570 --> 00:18:43.220
Not even Double Wing worked...

00:18:46.840 --> 00:18:48.480
Almost there!

00:18:50.200 --> 00:18:52.320
I'm on my way!

00:18:53.410 --> 00:18:55.230
Hissatsu tactics!

00:18:56.210 --> 00:18:58.440
Absolute Barrier!

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:00.450
Get past them this time!

00:19:10.730 --> 00:19:12.170
Hissatsu tactics!

00:19:12.440 --> 00:19:13.920
Double Wing!

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:17.420
Go right!

00:19:17.420 --> 00:19:18.150
Okay!

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:28.670
Why can't we get through?

00:19:28.670 --> 00:19:31.730
Double Wing should be perfect!

00:19:34.050 --> 00:19:37.780
Absolute Barrier is an invincible hissatsu tactics!

00:19:41.170 --> 00:19:43.300
Absolute Barrier!

00:19:43.300 --> 00:19:45.030
Double Wing!

00:20:04.950 --> 00:20:07.920
The speed of Matsukaze's passes isn't enough!

00:20:07.920 --> 00:20:10.260
Double Wing isn't complete!

00:20:11.070 --> 00:20:14.760
They're able to tell who has possession of the ball.

00:20:14.760 --> 00:20:15.490
Yeah.

00:20:15.490 --> 00:20:21.720
Even if the other team moves after the fact, they're able to make up for their speed due to the ice field.

00:20:22.430 --> 00:20:24.200
The speed of the passes, huh?

00:20:24.920 --> 00:20:29.190
I can't believe Absolute Barrier has been perfected to this extent...

00:20:30.220 --> 00:20:32.040
The awe-inspiring Hakuren Jr. High!

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:35.300
Now that Raimon's lost their way of attack, they're stuck defending again!

00:20:40.020 --> 00:20:43.130
Panther Blizzard!

00:20:47.630 --> 00:20:48.760
I'll get it this time!

00:20:52.600 --> 00:20:54.840
Fence Of Gaia!

00:20:59.660 --> 00:21:00.940
How's that?!

00:21:00.940 --> 00:21:03.230
Sangoku blocks it!

00:21:03.730 --> 00:21:04.900
Not yet!

00:21:05.320 --> 00:21:08.240
This... is my Avatar!

00:21:09.500 --> 00:21:10.470
That's...

00:21:10.470 --> 00:21:11.240
An Avatar!

00:21:16.980 --> 00:21:18.770
Abounding Snowfall Saya!

00:21:19.380 --> 00:21:21.410
Yukimura has an Avatar?!

00:22:53.700 --> 00:22:56.000
Raimon persists in getting through Absolute Barrier.

00:22:56.000 --> 00:22:57.600
Is it unbeatable after all?

00:22:57.600 --> 00:22:59.600
Just then, <i>he</i>  stands up!

00:22:59.600 --> 00:23:04.310
Next on Inazuma Eleven GO, 
 Fierce Fight On the Ice! VS Hakuren Jr. High!!

00:23:04.310 --> 00:23:06.390
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:14.870 --> 00:23:17.870
The Inazuma Eleven GO's proverb today is...

00:23:22.560 --> 00:23:27.100
You have to be serious at what you do, no matter what stage it is. 
 Otherwise, you can't move forward!

00:23:27.100 --> 00:23:27.770
That's all!
